#: includes/brikpanel-brikmentor-promo.php:794
msgid ""
"Show the BrikMentor card, menu item, corner button and the locked contact "
"buttons on BrikPanel screens. Turn this off to hide every BrikMentor "
"promotion, for example when you set up BrikPanel for a client."
msgstr ""
