msgstr "Zapisano Cię."

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:160
msgid "Thanks. We'll email you when there is something worth knowing."
msgstr "Dziękujemy. Napiszemy, gdy pojawi się coś wartego uwagi."

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:169
msgid ""
"Heads up: we could not reach our server from your site (some hosts block "
"outbound connections). We saved your request and will keep trying, but to be "
"safe you can message us on WhatsApp and we'll subscribe you by hand."
